## If this is a new machine

The search index is machine-local (`~/.cache/qmd/`), is never committed, and bakes in absolute paths. Rebuild it before doing anything else. Full procedure in `resources/docs/04-search-setup-qmd.md`.

```sh
{{SEARCH_CMD}} --version                    # install first if missing
{{SEARCH_CMD}} collection list              # both collections present? if yes, skip to update
{{SEARCH_CMD}} update                       # build the keyword index
{{SEARCH_CMD}} embed                        # first run downloads a ~318 MB model; 10–20 min for a few hundred files
{{SEARCH_CMD}} status                       # confirm: both collections, 0 pending embeddings
```

