## Ingestion pipeline (5 phases)

| Phase | Owner | Job |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | `wiki-extractor` (parallel, 1 per source) | Read source + `index.md` → return extraction |
| 2 | Main agent | Quality review → owner approves |
| 3 | `wiki-writer` (parallel, 1 per 2–3 sources) | Write files verbatim |
| 3.5 | `wiki-formatter` (parallel, 1 per 5–7 {{ENTRY_NOUN_PLURAL}}) | Format entry bodies |
| 4 | `wiki-verifier` (one) | Files exist, non-empty, frontmatter valid, counts match |
| 5 | Main agent | index, log, hubs, move originals, handover, re-index |

Full detail: `CLAUDE.md` and `resources/docs/02-ingestion-protocol.md`.

## Conventions (locked in)

Stable section — carry forward verbatim.

- **Originals are never modified.** A source is processed when `wiki/sources/{slug}.md` exists; only then does the original move to `{{PROCESSED_DIR}}/`.
- **Atomic entries only.** One {{ENTRY_NOUN}} per file.
- **Check `wiki/index.md` before creating anything.** Reinforce an existing entry rather than duplicating it.
- **Wikilinks are Foam syntax** — `[[filename-without-extension]]` — and may only name slugs that already exist in `index.md`.
- **First mention in body prose gets the wikilink.**
- **Frontmatter field names never drift:** `sources:` on entries, `entries_extracted:` on source summaries, `entries:` on topic hubs.
- **All sources are `.md`.** Convert on arrival.
- **Log the reasoning, not just the result** — dropped entries, rejected merges, flagged tensions.
- **One batch per session, and Phase 5 always completes before the session ends.**

